ess for Tessa, white shirt for Scott) and choreography (dramatic poses, close holds, stylized footwork) are consistent with the Tango Romantica rhythm.  \n- The scoreboard in frame 19 explicitly lists “ORIGINAL DANCE” as the segment being scored, with a score of 68.41.  \n- This confirms the performance is the **Original Dance**, not the Compulsory Dance (which came first) or Free Dance (which came later).\n\n---\n\n**Temporal Sequence Note:**\n\n- Frames 1–18: Performance of the Original Dance.  \n- Frames 19–29: Post-performance celebration and scoreboard reveal.  \n- The question specifically asks about what was *performed while wearing a white dress*, which refers to the performance segment — **Original Dance**.\n\n---\n\n✅ **Conclusion: The answer ‘0’ (Original Dance) is correct.**  \nAll six criteria are satisfied, and the performance context, costumes, choreography, and on-screen graphics confirm that the Original Dance was performed in Vancouver 2010 while Tessa Virtue wore a white dress."}], 'formatted_responses': ["\n=== Batch 0-30 (30 frames) ===\nFrames: /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0616.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0617.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0618.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0619.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0620.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0621.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0622.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0623.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0624.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0625.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0626.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2LH3JCGkEBU/frames/frame_0627.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_